// =====================================================================
// NOVA-SoC UVM integration marker (.uvm extension — VIKAS detects UVM
// intent from the manifest and runs UVM-aware elaboration).
//
// The full NOVA regression is a class-based UVM environment in the
// production flow (nova_env_pkg with nova_driver / nova_monitor /
// nova_scoreboard on `virtual nova_if`). For the offline VIKAS kernel
// demo the equivalent checking is done procedurally inside
// nova_soc_tb.sv so the design runs on any Linux box with zero deps.
//
//   +UVM_TESTNAME=nova_smoke_test
//   +UVM_VERBOSITY=UVM_MEDIUM
//   nova_sequences: nova_prog_load_seq, nova_uart_loopback_seq,
//                   nova_spi_loopback_seq, nova_timer_irq_seq
// =====================================================================
